  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. Fixture: a.py, gen_pb2.py (protoc header) and g.js (// @generated). The python analysis_run reports files_analyzed=2, javascript files_analyzed=1 with nodes_emitted=2, then limits.tier_filtered_files=['g.js','gen_pb2.py'] with max_tier_applied=3, so tier-4 files are still parsed and then dropped. On the open question: today the call main -> gen_pb2.make leaves no calls edge at all (neither the resolved target nor an external stub survives). MECHANISM: tier filter runs after analysis (cli.py ~13249-13307); analyzers receive tier-4 files and parse them. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: none."  # 8d4f
